  "prefLabel": "Tax 211.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 211.01 Applicability. This part, as well as Tax 101 and Tax 201, shall apply to all appeals of the DRA determinations of equalized valuation under RSA 71-B:5, II. Tax 201.19 and Tax 201.37 shall not apply in this part.\n\nSource. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
